      "color": "#4a2626",
      "bgcolor": "#281414",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Multiple references\n\nUp to **9 images, 3 videos, 3 audios** — the stock renderer allows only one.\n\nA reference does nothing until the prompt names it:\n\n| Tag | Points to |\n|---|---|\n| `<Picture 1>` | `reference_image` |\n| `<Picture 2>`…`<Picture 9>` | `ref_image_2…9` |\n| `<Video 1..3>` · `<Audio 1..3>` | video / audio refs |\n\nWrite the tags in **`custom_global_prompt`**:\n\n> the man in `<Picture 1>` wearing the jacket from `<Picture 2>`\n\nThat splits face / outfit / location into separate images.\n\n**Extra refs are not part of the resume contract.** Swapping one while keeping\nthe same `chain_id` silently reuses the old scenes — the `report` output prints\na fingerprint; when it changes, change `chain_id`.\n\nMore images of the *same* person means more consistency, not more variety. Tags\nare fixed for the whole chain, so one chain is one outfit.\n\nReference video: at least 5 frames, truncated to the scene length.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Multiple references\n\nUp to **9 images, 3 videos, 3 audios** — the stock renderer allows only one.\n\nA reference does nothing until the prompt names it:\n\n| Tag | Points to |\n|---|---|\n| `<Picture 1>` | `reference_image` |\n| `<Picture 2>`…`<Picture 9>` | `ref_image_2…9` |\n| `<Video 1..3>` · `<Audio 1..3>` | video / audio refs |\n\nWrite the tags in **`custom_global_prompt`**:\n\n> the man in `<Picture 1>` wearing the jacket from `<Picture 2>`\n\nThat splits face / outfit / location into separate images.\n\n**Extra refs are not part of the resume contract.** Swapping one while keeping\nthe same `chain_id` silently reuses the old scenes — the `report` output prints\na fingerprint; when it changes, change `chain_id`.\n\nMore images of the *same* person means more consistency, not more variety. Tags\nare fixed for the whole chain, so one chain is one outfit.\n\nReference video: at least 5 frames, truncated to the scene length.\n"
      }
    }
